            "text": {
              "ops": [
                {
                  "insert": "Two complementary AI interfaces sharing one intelligence core: FAB Chat (lightweight floating button for onboarding and quick answers) and Side AI (full agentic sidebar co-pilot with task CRUD, SA regulatory knowledge, audit trails). Differentiated by depth, tool access, and response style — unified by shared context, seamless escalation handoffs, and a single knowledge backbone.",
