              "ops": [
                {
                  "insert": "DIMENSION: Knowledge Depth — FAB: App features, basic FAQs, SA process summaries (< 200 words). Side AI: Full SA regulatory corpus, CIPC/Mining/SARS/POPIA docs, task history, per-user context.",
